Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.88,注释,,0,0,0,,翻译  1440kHz
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.65,0:00:04.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,﻿最好把那个还回来  射线恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.65,0:00:04.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You better give that back, Man Ray
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.99,0:00:07.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.99,0:00:07.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or what?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.02,0:00:09.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然我就把它夺回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.02,0:00:09.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or I'll take it back
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.89,0:00:15.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好迎接一大份的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.89,0:00:15.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now prepare for a heaping helping
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.13,0:00:17.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,速干塔塔酱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.13,0:00:17.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of quick-drying tartar sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:17.63,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(304,343.112)}塔塔酱
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.30,0:00:19.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.30,0:00:19.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.14,0:00:22.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,空了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:22.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Empty?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.94,0:00:23.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:23.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.14,0:00:25.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.14,0:00:25.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.04,0:00:29.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哎哟喂  没塔塔酱就硬气不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:29.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well, not so tough without your tartar sa--
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.45,0:00:34.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.45,0:00:34.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who was that?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.42,0:00:35.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.42,0:00:35.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.42,0:00:38.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家叫我  超级铁公鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.42,0:00:38.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They call me "Super Tightwad"
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.15,0:00:40.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是服务费账单
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.15,0:00:40.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here's me bill for services rendered
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.12,0:00:40.39,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(167,193.333)}超级英雄服务发票\N\N塔塔酱\N超级英雄工会\N塔塔酱回收费
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.39,0:00:41.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.39,0:00:41.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.59,0:00:41.26,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(221,341.333)}共计
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.26,0:00:42.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们可没那么多钱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.26,0:00:42.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We don't have that kind of money
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.99,0:00:44.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没钱是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.99,0:00:44.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No money, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.09,0:00:49.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,两份蟹黄堡马上就来  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.09,0:00:49.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Two Krabby Patties coming right up, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.16,0:00:50.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,表现不错  小子们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:50.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Doing great, boys
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.40,0:00:53.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们再干六年的活就能还完债了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:53.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just six more years of work to pay off your debt
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.57,0:00:57.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感觉射线恶魔突然没那么邪恶了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.57,0:00:57.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Man Ray suddenly doesn't seem very evil
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.71,0:00:58.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.71,0:00:58.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
